{"id":"859c7c30677dd487","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/608_条件逻辑_CK.md","title":"608 条件逻辑 CK","display":"608_条件逻辑_CK","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{cond}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{cond}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。显示记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>构造子完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换、$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{608}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{608}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{608}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{608}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{608}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{608}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{608}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{608}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{608}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\Rightarrow B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\Rightarrow\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{608}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{608}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{608}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{608}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{608}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{608}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{608}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{608}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{608}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad A\\equiv_{\\alpha,608}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{608}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad A\\equiv_{\\alpha,608}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{608}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{608}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{608}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{608}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{608}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{608}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>CK 条件分配公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{608}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{608}\n=\n\\{(A\\Rightarrow(B\\to C))\\to((A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{608}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{608}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{608}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{608}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{608}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{608}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{608}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{608}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{608}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{608}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{608}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{608}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>CK 的条件后件规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{608}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{608}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{608}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{608}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{608}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{608}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{608}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{608}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>。每行理由为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{608}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{608}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{608}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{608}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{608}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{608}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{608}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{608}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{608}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{608}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于证明的任意非空前缀仍是证明，第 7 节的定义等价于末行规范式</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{608}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{608}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{608}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{608}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{608}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{608}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{608}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{608}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{608}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则的显示分式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{608}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{608}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{608}B\\to C}{\\vdash_{608}(A\\Rightarrow B)\\to(A\\Rightarrow C)}\\;(RCK).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-选择函数语义\">8. 选择函数语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"608\">\\(608\\)</span>-选择函数模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CMod}_{608}\">\\(\\mathsf{CMod}_{608}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\to B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\to B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\Rightarrow B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\Rightarrow B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系和语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{608}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{608}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{608}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{608}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{CMod}_{608}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{608}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{608}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{608}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{CMod}_{608}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{608}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{608}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的唯一条件特异公理是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{608}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CK}^{608}\\)</span>，唯一条件规则是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{608}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCK}^{608}\\)</span>；不加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow A\">\\(A\\Rightarrow A\\)</span>、CEM、中心性或反事实特异公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>每个条件公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow B\">\\(A\\Rightarrow B\\)</span> 的形成、自由变元、替换、规则使用和证明行侧条件都已在本文件内定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CK}_{608}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\operatorname{FV}_{608},\\operatorname{BV}_{608},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{608},\\operatorname{Sub}_{608},\\equiv_{\\alpha,608},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{608},\\mathsf{Rule}_{608},\\mathsf{Proof}_{608},\\operatorname{last}_{608},\n\\vdash_{608},\\mathsf{Thm}_{608},\\mathsf{Cert}_{608},\n\\mathsf{CMod}_{608},⟦-⟧_{608},\\Vdash_{608},\\models_{608}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CK}_{608}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\operatorname{FV}_{608},\\operatorname{BV}_{608},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{608},\\operatorname{Sub}_{608},\\equiv_{\\alpha,608},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{608},\\mathsf{Rule}_{608},\\mathsf{Proof}_{608},\\operatorname{last}_{608},\n\\vdash_{608},\\mathsf{Thm}_{608},\\mathsf{Cert}_{608},\n\\mathsf{CMod}_{608},⟦-⟧_{608},\\Vdash_{608},\\models_{608}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含条件公式、公理、规则、有限证明、选择函数模型、满足关系与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或可判定性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换、$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换、$\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-选择函数语义","text":"8. 选择函数语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{cond}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\qquad A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad A\\Rightarrow B=\\operatorname{cond}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cond}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{608}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\i